pumbo-translate-mv
==================

Version translation for Minecraft Java Edition (clients 1.21-26.2 on a 26.3
server), part of PumboProx. Licensed under GPL-3.0-only like the rest of
PumboProx (see LICENSE in the repository root), so that code from
ViaBackwards and ViaVersion (GPL-3.0) can be ported into it.

pumpkin-java-multiversion
-------------------------

This crate started as a port of pumpkin-java-multiversion by Zinedin Polic
and contributors (https://github.com/zinedinp/pumpkin-java-multiversion,
branch `rework-network`, commit 3aa2d0ed9cc78e11af637d64e5e0f9f1a76dc71a of
2026-10-05), licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; its license texts are in
`licenses/LICENSE-MIT` and `licenses/LICENSE-APACHE` and apply to the parts
taken from it. Taken from it: the structure (translation on raw payloads per
packet, encoding eras, per-connection entity types), the translation logic of
the packets it covers for 1.21-26.2, and the entity data table generator
(`examples/entity_data.rs`, from its `build.rs`). Its Pumpkin dependencies
(pumpkin-protocol, pumpkin-data, pumpkin-nbt, pumpkin-util,
pumpkin-plugin-api) are not used; readers, writers and remaps are written
anew here.

ViaBackwards and ViaVersion
---------------------------

Conversions marked in the code with "ViaBackwards" or "ViaVersion" are ported
from ViaBackwards (https://github.com/ViaVersion/ViaBackwards, commit
ec63e9f8084f965c5bb085a428844a98be111ada of 2026-10-01) and ViaVersion
(https://github.com/ViaVersion/ViaVersion, commit
b83268efa03d9729a82fa165f78cc99c794446fd of 2026-10-08), GPL-3.0-or-later,
Copyright (C) 2016-2026 ViaVersion and contributors: the data component
layouts per version (ViaVersion `StructuredDataKey` and the types in
`api/minecraft/item/data`), their downgrades (ViaBackwards
`BlockItemPacketRewriter*` of the protocols 26_3to26_2 ... 1_21_2to1_21) and
the block entity changes (`BlockPacketRewriter26_3`,
`BlockItemPacketRewriter26_2`, `BlockPacketRewriter1_21_5`), and the way
diff mappings are applied per step (ViaVersion Mappings
`MappingsLoader.mapEntry`, GPL-3.0, see below).

Data
----

- `data/entity_data.txt` is generated from tracked entity data extracted from
  Minecraft by Pumpkin's extractor: `assets/tracked_data` and
  `assets/meta_data_type` of pumpkin-java-multiversion (1.21-26.2) and of
  Pumpkin (https://github.com/Pumpkin-MC/Pumpkin, commit
  3b1abcded53353222eab15c84538784eb345b64e, 26.3). These are facts about
  Minecraft (names and numbers), (c) Mojang Studios / Microsoft.
- `data/via_mappings.txt` (stand-ins for block states, items, sounds,
  particles and entity types older clients lack) is generated by
  `examples/via_mappings.rs` from the diff files of ViaVersion Mappings
  (https://github.com/ViaVersion/Mappings, commit
  6747b8f73880743ab12f2c65046b6934c6643340 of 2026-10-06; "the files under
  `mappings/` are free to copy, use, and expand upon in whatever way you
  like"), with one change listed in the generator (mannequins).

Protocol knowledge also comes from the minecraft.wiki protocol pages
(CC BY-SA 3.0) and PrismarineJS minecraft-data (MIT).
